<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Petrochem union says delays partial strike.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Petrochem union says delays partial strike.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The unionised workers of Hyundai Petrochemical Co, a unit of South Korea's giant Hyundai Group, have postponed their partial strike in protest at a new labour law to Thursday, a union head said.</p>
<p>The union had originally planned to go on strike starting 4:30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
